  "functional_domain": "News and Announcement Management",
  "overview": "The Global and Course-Specific News and Announcement Management System provides a comprehensive solution for creating, managing, and displaying announcements and news items across the platform. This merged cluster integrates a Ruby on Rails web frontend with a dedicated microservice, the `Xikolo News Service`, to handle both administrative operations and public dissemination. It supports general announcements, course-specific messages, and homepage news, with robust features for email notifications, recipient targeting, and read tracking.",
